msgctxt "120"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Date-san, what are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu! I'm, uh, just here on an errand..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Errand? What happened to watching Haruka?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Oh, I told her I was going shopping. She's over at Serena\r\n"
"right now, so I really should be heading back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Well, are you going inside or not? Just staring at the window won't help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Ah, no, I was just... window shopping, that's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "You sure about that? Looks to me like you came here to buy someone a gift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Well, yeah, but... I don't really know what to get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Who's it for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "...You swear not to laugh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "It's for Mama. You know... the owner of Serena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Ah... You do have a thing for her. I was right after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"What do you mean, you were \"right\"? How about you get \"right\" out of my "
"business!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "I could, but I find that your business with Mama is way more interesting..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "So you're really gonna buy her a present, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"Oh, I get it! Why would a beautiful young woman go out with\r\n"
"a lonely old fart like me, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "I was just pulling your leg. You know I stand behind you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Yeah, stand behind me while I crash and burn... Well,\r\n"
"at least I got that off my chest. Now let's just get this\r\n"
"over with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "I hope it goes well."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"Thanks. I'm glad I finally got that off my chest. All right,\r\n"
"let's get this over with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "I've gotta ask you, Date-san. How did you find out Mama's ring size?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Heh, another trick of the trade. I told Mama I was getting a ring for my "
"daughter, then just slipped the question in there. She never suspected a "
"thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"Right, Saya-chan must be a young adult now... But Date-san, I never knew "
"you were such a sly devil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Hah. Well, you have to be, if you wanna live to be my age."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you gained a lot of wisdom from your previous marriage, too. By "
"the way, was it you who helped Mama get settled into Serena?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"Yeah. After what happened to Reina, no one would rent the\r\n"
"property. People thought some kind of curse hung over the\r\n"
"place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "And Mama didn't mind that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"Not one bit. The price had gotten so cheap, she was practically begging me "
"for the details."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"I gotta say, I've never seen a lady with that much spunk. She'd probably do "
"well no matter where she set up shop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Is that what you like about her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Maybe so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"(Would Mama really accept a ring from Date-san? Guess I'll find out once "
"we're back at Serena.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "You're really gonna buy her a present?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "I hope it goes well."
msgstr ""

